message: "If you use this dataset / methodology, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "evals-agentic-control: Pre-registered adversarial-prompt battery for agentic computer-use safety"
abstract: "Pre-registered adversarial-prompt battery run against frontier and open-weight language models through a capability-gated computer-use harness. Hypotheses and falsifiers registered before runs via pre-registration. Type-I (overclaim) and Type-II (missed risk) catches recorded per verdict. AGPL-3.0."
